        "P5": "event.wsdl: attribute WSPullPointSupport added to tev:Capabilities, it was removed upstream but is evaluated by the IO",
        "P6": "Elements of a WSDL removed by P3 that are used by wsdl:part (e.g. tds:GetRelayOutputs in deviceio.wsdl) copied into an own xs:schema, otherwise ext/soap sends an empty body"
